<title>UK: Midland Bank sets 150 mln stg 10-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Midland Bank sets 150 mln stg 10-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following structured floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager HSBC Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MIDLAND BANK</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN STG   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	*JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    *+20 BP    PAY DATE    23.JUN.97</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   ISS PRICE  99.873    FULL FEES   0.35</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   REOFFER    99.873</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALL AT PAR IN JUN.2002 AFTER WHICH THE MARGIN</p>
<p>		RISES TO 70 B.P.</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 1-10-1M   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  HONG KONG TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
